UnitVelodromeMigration::ReviveLeafGauges
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── when the gauges array is empty
    │   └── it should not call the V2 emergency council
    ├── when gauges are provided
    │   └── it should revive every leaf gauge through the V2 emergency council
    └── given the contract is paused
        └── it should revive every leaf gauge through the V2 emergency council
